{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：部分感受意象堆叠得过密或跳得太远，例如“私语变成天地共振”“多年后走进旧房子”，有时会让观众感觉作者在用力制造诗意，而不是细致呈现人物当下的感受。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把主要叙述拆成相对独立的短句，并用放大加亮的关键词提供明确的视觉落点，感受文字又有大小层级和音乐时机的区分，观众不必一次读完所有内容。更重要的是，它保留了人物从害怕给对方添负担、逐渐感到彼此需要，到害怕失去、最后接受自己无法保证永远的心理递进，尤其是S07、S11、S13，对人物动机和情感变化的交代比X更充分。X的长句读起来更连贯自然，但部分关键心理层次被压缩，Y则需要控制少数感受意象的堆叠。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6b8177fd-9bed-42ca-8a04-70e9dd50337a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T193627233684Z", "elapsed_seconds": 153.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:39:00.978626+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "27260632ff65d0b08d82ac334d2a1c430581e7006438a775338d271b609f0ec3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222